   1:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c **** /**
   2:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   * @file    stm32f4xx_rtc.c
   4:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
