1480:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c **** /**
1481:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   * @brief  Configures the RTC Wakeup clock source.
1482:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   * @note   The WakeUp Clock source can only be changed when the RTC WakeUp
1483:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   *         is disabled (Use the RTC_WakeUpCmd(DISABLE)).      
