1487:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   *            @arg RTC_WakeUpClock_RTCCLK_Div8: RTC Wakeup Counter Clock = RTCCLK/8
1488:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   *            @arg RTC_WakeUpClock_RTCCLK_Div4: RTC Wakeup Counter Clock = RTCCLK/4
1489:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   *            @arg RTC_WakeUpClock_RTCCLK_Div2: RTC Wakeup Counter Clock = RTCCLK/2
