2425:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   * @brief  Configures the Synchronization Shift Control Settings.
2426:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   * @note   When REFCKON is set, firmware must not write to Shift control register 
2427:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   * @param  RTC_ShiftAdd1S : Select to add or not 1 second to the time Calendar.
2428:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   *   This parameter can be one of the following values :
2429:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   *     @arg RTC_ShiftAdd1S_Set  : Add one second to the clock calendar. 
2430:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   *     @arg RTC_ShiftAdd1S_Reset: No effect.
2431:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   * @param  RTC_ShiftSubFS: Select the number of Second Fractions to Substitute.
2432:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   *         This parameter can be one any value from 0 to 0x7FFF.
2433:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   * @retval An ErrorStatus enumeration value:
2434:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   *          - SUCCESS: RTC Shift registers are configured
2435:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   *          - ERROR: RTC Shift registers are not configured
2436:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c **** */
2437:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c **** ErrorStatus RTC_SynchroShiftConfig(uint32_t RTC_ShiftAdd1S, uint32_t RTC_ShiftSubFS)
2438:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c **** {
2439:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   ErrorStatus status = ERROR;
2440:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   uint32_t shpfcount = 0;
2441:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c **** 
2442:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****   /* Check the parameters */
