2499:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****  *  @brief   Interrupts and flags management functions  
2500:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****  *
2501:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c **** @verbatim   
2502:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****  ===============================================================================
2503:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****               ##### Interrupts and flags management functions #####
2504:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****  ===============================================================================  
2505:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****  [..] All RTC interrupts are connected to the EXTI controller.
2506:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****  
2507:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****    (+) To enable the RTC Alarm interrupt, the following sequence is required:
2508:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****        (++) Configure and enable the EXTI Line 17 in interrupt mode and select 
2509:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             the rising edge sensitivity using the EXTI_Init() function.
2510:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****        (++) Configure and enable the RTC_Alarm IRQ channel in the NVIC using the 
2511:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             NVIC_Init() function.
2512:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****        (++) Configure the RTC to generate RTC alarms (Alarm A and/or Alarm B) using
2513:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             the RTC_SetAlarm() and RTC_AlarmCmd() functions.
2514:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c **** 
2515:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****    (+) To enable the RTC Wakeup interrupt, the following sequence is required:
2516:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****        (++) Configure and enable the EXTI Line 22 in interrupt mode and select the
2517:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             rising edge sensitivity using the EXTI_Init() function.
2518:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****        (++) Configure and enable the RTC_WKUP IRQ channel in the NVIC using the 
2519:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             NVIC_Init() function.
2520:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****        (++) Configure the RTC to generate the RTC wakeup timer event using the 
2521:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             RTC_WakeUpClockConfig(), RTC_SetWakeUpCounter() and RTC_WakeUpCmd() 
2522:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             functions.
2523:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c **** 
2524:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****    (+) To enable the RTC Tamper interrupt, the following sequence is required:
2525:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****        (++) Configure and enable the EXTI Line 21 in interrupt mode and select 
2526:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             the rising edge sensitivity using the EXTI_Init() function.
2527:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****        (++) Configure and enable the TAMP_STAMP IRQ channel in the NVIC using the
2528:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             NVIC_Init() function.
2529:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****        (++) Configure the RTC to detect the RTC tamper event using the 
2530:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             RTC_TamperTriggerConfig() and RTC_TamperCmd() functions.
2531:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c **** 
2532:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****    (+) To enable the RTC TimeStamp interrupt, the following sequence is required:
2533:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****        (++) Configure and enable the EXTI Line 21 in interrupt mode and select the
2534:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             rising edge sensitivity using the EXTI_Init() function.
2535:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****        (++) Configure and enable the TAMP_STAMP IRQ channel in the NVIC using the 
2536:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             NVIC_Init() function.
2537:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****        (++) Configure the RTC to detect the RTC time stamp event using the 
2538:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rtc.c ****             RTC_TimeStampCmd() functions.
